raw/cdc/current-index.html:469:<li class="level-1">Skills such as taking a first step, smiling for the first time, and waving &ldquo;bye bye&rdquo; are called developmental milestones.</li>
raw/cdc/current-index.html:470:<li class="level-1">Children reach milestones in how they play, learn, speak, act, and move.</li>
