+  "CDC-24-LC-01": [[627,478], "loose", "Matching items to pictures or identifying story characters omits the requested pointing response to a named book picture."],
+  "CDC-24-LC-03": [[307,573,702], "loose", "One pointed body part is too few; naming three or smaller parts uses a different response and higher threshold."],
