+  "CDC-12-MP-03": [[103,686], "loose", "General correct cup/item use omits adult holding and lid status; one-handed drinking adds a different motor requirement."],
+  "CDC-15-SE-02": [[340], "loose", "Pointing to show is a different gesture from showing an object; the pointing question is paired with CDC's eighteen-month pointing item."],
